<title>BRAZIL: Itau Q1 net rises to 165 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Itau Q1 net rises to 165 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private Brazilian bank Banco</p>
<p>Itau, one of the country's leading retail banks, released the</p>
<p>following first-quarter 1997 results.</p>
<p>		   Q1 1997	     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    Share	  13.81		 12.01</p>
<p>    Net	    165 million	     143 million</p>
<p>    Fin Revs   1.471 bln	   1.66 bln</p>
<p>    Oper Income  217 million	     307 million</p>
<p>    Net Worth  3.957 bln	   3.444 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Share figures per lot of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
